SELECTION SORT - select smallest element and put it in respective index
-------------
keep smallest in front

min=a[i]

i=0
for j=0=i+1>
    find min
swap


eg:
i=0
   min=0 idx
   actual min = 4
   swap [0,4]


 INSERTION SORT  PICK ELEMENT AND INSERT IN CORRECT POSITION
 ------------
RIGHT TO LEFT
 5 4 6 3 2

 ASSUME FIRST ELEMENT IN CORRECT POSITION

I=1 COMPARE AND KEEP I

MERGE SORT - DIVIDE TO SINGLE ELEMENT, SORT AND COMBINE WITH EACH
-------
DIVIDE AND CONQUER


